# Obsidian vault config — share the settings, ignore the per-user state.
# Ignore everything .obsidian drops, then re-admit the three shareable files:
#   app.json (link format, new-file location, excluded files)
#   core-plugins.json (which core plugins are on)
#   templates.json (where the Templates plugin looks)
# Everything else — workspace/graph/cache/bookmarks/hotkeys — is per-user layout
# or viewport state, and committing it is a diff for nobody but its author.
docs/.obsidian/*
!docs/.obsidian/app.json
!docs/.obsidian/core-plugins.json
!docs/.obsidian/templates.json
